  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The Self Care Club began as a virtual community designed to promote positive vibes. &nbsp;My focus has always been to create a Safe Space for people all over the world to unite with the goal of healing through self care. &nbsp;When we are mindful of our own needs, we are better able to support the people we care about. People who care for themselves have a better understanding of their needs and tend to create healthy boundaries for those around them. Whether you are gardening or writing in a journal, self care has the potential to make you feel alive. &nbsp;Self Care is NOT Selfish! &nbsp;It is a necessity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All of our products are designed to motivate &amp; empower you to keep growing through the things you a going through in life. &nbsp;Since self care looks different for everyone, we carry a wide of products, which include affirmative apparel, skin care, drinkware &amp; other motivational merch.</p>\r\n</div>",
